# Keep build context minimal and secrets out of images. Build-time config
# (tsconfig, vite.config.ts, tsr.config.json, components.json) and nginx/
# MUST stay in the context — the Vite build and runtime stage consume them.
#
# `.gitignore` MUST stay too: Tailwind's source scanner honours it, so without
# it the prerender pass rescans the client build in dist/ and emits a second
# stylesheet — the shell then links a CSS hash that is never shipped (404 +
# flash of unstyled content on every page load).
node_modules
dist
.tanstack
.env
.env.*
.git
.vscode
*.md
.prettierignore
prettier.config.js
eslint.config.js
.cursorrules
.cta.json
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
